SON input example\n    init                Create state once; never overwrite an existing book\n    status              Compact checkpoint and export health\n    migrate             Explicit schema upgrade with a consistent rollback\n                        backup\n    audit               Strictly check managed exports without repairing or\n                        recording them\n    outline-audit       Read-only structural check of a whole-book outline,\n                        including candidates\n    world-save          Save structured story state with cited evidence\n    world-check         Check recorded rules, knowledge and continuity\n    world-read          Inspect one stored narrative record, including stale\n                        evidence for reviewed repair\n    cache-get           Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    cache-put           Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-dependencies\n                        Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-deps        Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-inspect     Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-publish     Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-refresh     Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-saved       Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-snapshot    Versioned dependencies, reviewed historical branches,\n                        and evidence-bound caches\n    history-start    